   "html": "<meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\"><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Explore Pierce CO real estate with Christine Gwinnup. Find homes with acreage, horse properties, and land for sale. Your dream home is waiting.\"><meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"homes for sale pierce co, pierce colorado real estate, pierce co horse properties, land for sale in pierce co, homes with acreage pierce co, move to pierce colorado, pierce co property listings, commute from pierce to fort collins, best realtors in pierce co, sell my home pierce co\">\r\n<title></title>\r\n<style type=\"text/css\">body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; margin: 0; color: #333; background-color: #fdfdfd; }\r\n    header.hero { background: url('https://www.thelittleladysellshomes.com/images/pierce-hero.jpg') center/cover no-repeat; color: white; padding: 80px 20px; text-align: center; }\r\n    header.hero h1 { font-size: 3em; margin: 0; }\r\n    header.hero p { font-size: 1.25em; margin-top: 10px; }\r\n    section { padding: 40px 20px; max-width: 1000px; margin: auto; }\r\n    h2 { color: #8B0000; font-size: 1.8em; margin-bottom: 10px; }\r\n    ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; }\r\n    li { margin: 10px 0; }\r\n    a { color: #8B0000; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; }\r\n    a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }\r\n    .video-placeholder { position: relative; padding-bottom: 56.25%; height: 0; overflow: hidden; }\r\n    .video-placeholder iframe { position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; }\r\n    .cta { text-align: center; background: #fff5f5; border-top: 2px solid #8B0000; padding: 50px 20px; }\r\n    .btn { display: inline-block; margin: 10px; padding: 12px 24px; background-color: #8B0000; color: white; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; }\r\n    .btn.secondary { background-color: #555; }\r\n    .site-footer { text-align: center; font-size: 0.9em; color: #777; padding: 20px; }\r\n</style>\r\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n    {\r\n      \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\r\n      \"@type\": \"RealEstateAgent\",\r\n      \"name\": \"Christine Gwinnup\",\r\n      \"image\": \"https://www.thelittleladysellshomes.com/images/christine-profile.jpg\",\r\n      \"url\": \"https://www.thelittleladysellshomes.com\",\r\n      \"areaServed\": {\r\n        \"@type\": \"Place\",\r\n        \"name\": \"Pierce, CO\",\r\n        \"address\": {\r\n          \"@type\": \"PostalAddress\",\r\n          \"addressLocality\": \"Pierce\",\r\n          \"addressRegion\": \"CO\",\r\n          \"addressCountry\": \"US\"\r\n        }\r\n      },\r\n      \"description\": \"Top real estate agent in Pierce CO specializing in homes with land, horse properties, and rural living in Weld County.\",\r\n      \"telephone\": \"+1-303-709-4262\"\r\n    }\r\n  </script>\r\n<header class=\"hero\">\r\n<h1><span style=\"color:#000000;\">&nbsp;Find Your Freedom in Pierce, Colorado</span></h1>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\">Horse property. Mountain views. Space to breathe. Let&rsquo;s make it yours.</span></p>\r\n</header>\r\n\r\n<section>\r\n<h2>Why Pierce?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Pierce isn&rsquo;t just a place to live &mdash; it&rsquo;s where you <em>live well</em>. With endless skies, rural charm, and Weld County affordability, it&rsquo;s no wonder more buyers are choosing this gem of a town. Whether you're searching for land, a hobby farm, or a home with views, <strong>Pierce has it</strong>.</p>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<section>\r\n<h2>Most-Searched Real Estate in Pierce CO</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li><a href=\"https://bxpx4.edit.ihouseelite.com/results-gallery/?city=Pierce&amp;sortby=PriceDesc\">Homes for Sale in Pierce, CO</a></li>\r\n\t<li><a href=\"https://bxpx4.edit.ihouseelite.com/results-gallery/?city=Pierce&amp;keywords=horse\">Pierce CO Horse Properties</a></li>\r\n\t<li><a href=\"https://bxpx4.edit.ihouseelite.com/results-gallery/?city=Pierce&amp;type=land\">Land for Sale in Pierce CO</a></li>\r\n\t<li><a href=\"https://bxpx4.edit.ihouseelite.com/results-gallery/?city=Pierce&amp;keywords=acreage\">Homes with Acreage in Pierce CO</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<section>\r\n<h2>Commute Times from Pierce</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Living rural doesn&rsquo;t mean living remote. Here&rsquo;s how long it takes:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>Fort Collins &ndash; ~30-35 min</li>\r\n\t<li>Greeley &ndash; ~20 min</li>\r\n\t<li>Eaton &ndash; ~10 min</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<section>\r\n<h2>Can You Have Chickens?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>You bet! Depending on your zoning, backyard hens are generally allowed. Just double-check Pierce&rsquo;s official guidelines. <a href=\"https://www.piercecolo.gov/our-community/living-in-pierce\" target=\"_blank\">Learn more here</a>.</p>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<section>\r\n<h2>Featured Listing in Pierce, CO</h2>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"video-placeholder\"><iframe allowfullscreen=\"\" frameborder=\"0\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/dVonJhu_zCo?si=kMiAnINsrO3RSIIO\" title=\"Featured Home in Pierce CO\"></iframe></div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<section>\r\n<h2>Pierce Heritage + Local Resources</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li><a href=\"https://www.piercecolo.gov/pages/our-history\" target=\"_blank\">History of Pierce, CO</a></li>\r\n\t<li><a href=\"https://www.piercecolo.gov/our-community/living-in-pierce\" target=\"_blank\">Living in Pierce: Town Info</a></li>\r\n\t<li><a href=\"/mnt/data/flood-what-handout.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Download: Weld County Flood Zone Info (PDF)</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<section class=\"cta\">\r\n<h2>✨ Let&rsquo;s Find You That Perfect Piece of Pierce</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>As a top listing specialist and proud local, I bring serious marketing muscle and small-town heart to every deal.</p>\r\n<a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://www.thelittleladysellshomes.com/contact\">Let&rsquo;s Chat</a> <a class=\"btn secondary\" href=\"https://www.thelittleladysellshomes.com/home-valuation\">Get My Home Valuation</a></section>\r\n\r\n<footer class=\"site-footer\">\r\n<p>&copy; 2025 Christine Gwinnup | The Little Lady Sells Homes | LPT Realty</p>\r\n</footer>\r\n\n"
